---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "AI Resources for Australian Businesses | Ad On Group"
description: "Plain-English guides to AI for Australian businesses — what the terms mean, how the tools differ, and what actually matters when you put AI to work."
bodyClass: "resource resource-index"
permalink: "/resources/index.html"
---
<div class="resource-hub">

  <h1>AI resources</h1>

  <p class="resource-hub-intro">
    Plain-English guides to artificial intelligence for Australian businesses.
    No jargon, no hype, and no assumption that you write code — just what each
    thing actually is, when it matters, and what to do about it.
  </p>

  {% set topics = ["Foundations", "Tools & comparisons", "Working with AI", "Risk & governance"] %}
  {% for topic in topics %}
    {% set items = [] %}
    {% for post in collections.resource %}
      {% if post.data.topic == topic %}{% set items = (items.push(post), items) %}{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
    {% if items.length %}
    <section class="resource-hub-group">
      <h2>{{ topic }}</h2>
      <div class="resource-hub-grid">
        {% for post in items %}
        <a class="resource-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
          <span class="resource-card-kind">{{ post.data.kind or "Explainer" }}</span>
          <span class="resource-card-title">{{ post.data.cardTitle or post.data.h1 or post.data.title }}</span>
          {% if post.data.cardBlurb %}<span class="resource-card-blurb">{{ post.data.cardBlurb }}</span>{% endif %}
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}

  <section class="resource-hub-cta">
    <h2>Want your team using this, not just reading about it?</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="/ad-on-ai-division/">Ad On AI</a> runs a three-month, self-paced
      AI enablement program for Australian businesses — non-technical staff go
      from first prompts to working AI agents, on their own real work.
    </p>
    <p class="aog-form-cta"><a href="/contact-us/">Talk to us &rarr;</a></p>
  </section>

</div>
